            "description": "<!-- Innodata AI Hackathon | 01a-about | no JavaScript, self-contained, Innodata brand guidelines -->\n<div class=\"ih\">\n<style>\n@import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=League+Spartan:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\");\nhtml { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n.ih {\n  --black:#000; --grey:#f1f2f2; --white:#fff; --blue:#0070c0; --orange:#dc8435; --char:#474747;\n  font-family: \"League Spartan\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--char); background: var(--white);\n}\n.ih *, .ih *::before, .ih *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n.ih h1,.ih h2,.ih h3,.ih h4,.ih p,.ih ul,.ih ol { margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n.ih ul,.ih ol { list-style: none; }\n.ih a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }\n.ih a:focus-visible, .ih summary:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--orange); outline-offset: 3px; }\n.ih .wrap { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }\n.ih .sec { padding: 80px 0; }\n.ih h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 400; color: var(--char); letter-spacing: -.01em; }\n.ih .lead { max-width: 60ch; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 1.1rem; }\n \n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { html { scroll-behavior: auto; } }\n/* About */\n.ih .ab-grid { display: grid; gap: 28px; align-items: center; }\n.ih .ab-facts { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 26px; }\n.ih .ab-facts li { padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--grey); color: var(--black); font-size: 1rem; }\n.ih .ab-facts b { font-weight: 500; color: var(--blue); }\n.ih .ab-copy { padding: 28px 30px; border-radius: 22px; border: 2px solid transparent;\n  background: linear-gradient(#fff, #fff) padding-box, linear-gradient(130deg, var(--blue), var(--orange)) border-box; }\n.ih .ab-copy p { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--char); }\n.ih .ab-copy p + p { margin-top: 14px; }\n.ih .ab-copy b { font-weight: 500; color: var(--black); }\n.ih .ab-hl { font-weight: 500; color: var(--blue); }\n.ih .ab-hl2 { font-weight: 500; color: var(--black); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--orange); text-decoration-thickness: 2px; text-underline-offset: 4px; }\n.ih .ab-pillars { display: grid; gap: 16px; margin-top: 36px; }\n.ih .ab-pillar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; padding: 24px; border-radius: 20px; color: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16); background: var(--black); }\n.ih .ab-pillar.p1 { background: radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 150% at 100% 100%, rgba(0,112,192,.75), transparent 70%), var(--black); }\n.ih .ab-pillar.p3 { background: radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 150% at 100% 100%, rgba(220,132,53,.65), transparent 70%), var(--black); }\n.ih .ab-icon { flex: none; width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: rgba(255,255,255,.14); }\n.ih .ab-icon svg { width: 26px; height: 26px; fill: none; stroke: #fff; stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }\n.ih .ab-pillar h3 { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.15; color: #fff; }\n.ih .ab-pillar p { margin-top: 4px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.4; color: rgba(255,255,255,.88); }\n@media (min-width: 860px) {\n  .ih .ab-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,.95fr) minmax(0,1.05fr); gap: 56px; }\n  .ih .ab-pillars { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr)); }\n}\n</style>\n \n<section class=\"sec\" id=\"about\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"ab-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <h2>An AI engineering and evaluation challenge built for real-world impact.</h2>\n        <ul class=\"ab-facts\">\n          <li><b>2</b> tracks</li>\n          <li><b>Virtual</b> build phase</li>\n          <li><b>₹10 Lakh</b> prize pool</li>\n          <li><b>Grand Finale</b> in New Delhi</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ab-copy\">\n        <p>The <b>Innodata AI Hackathon</b> is a nationwide AI engineering challenge, hosted by <b>Innodata</b> and powered by <b>Hack2skill</b>.</p>\n        <p>This isn’t your average app-building event. Teams <span class=\"ab-hl\">build, test and benchmark</span> next-generation AI systems, from synthetic data generators to automated testing pipelines that reveal what frontier models can really do.</p>\n        <p>As Innodata advances as a global AI-native company, we’re inviting India’s top <span class=\"ab-hl2\">AI/ML talent, developers and campus innovators</span> to solve real-world AI engineering problems, with expert mentorship along the way.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <ul class=\"ab-pillars\">\n      <li class=\"ab-pillar p1\"><span class=\"ab-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a4 4 0 0 0-5.4 5.4L3.5 17.5a1.8 1.8 0 0 0 2.5 2.5l5.8-5.8a4 4 0 0 0 5.4-5.4l-2.6 2.6-2.4-.6-.6-2.4z\"/></svg></span><div><h3>Build</h3><p>Reusable pipelines that generate evaluation tasks and data.</p></div></li>\n      <li class=\"ab-pillar p2\"><span class=\"ab-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3l8 3v6c0 4.5-3.4 8-8 9-4.6-1-8-4.5-8-9V6z\"/><path d=\"M8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5\"/></svg></span><div><h3>Test</h3><p>Verifiable checks that frontier models can’t shortcut.</p></div></li>\n      <li class=\"ab-pillar p3\"><span class=\"ab-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 20V10M10 20V4M16 20v-7M22 20H2\"/></svg></span><div><h3>Benchmark</h3><p>Measure how frontier AI models really perform.</p></div></li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</div>",
